WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.620
Israel does not have the World’s the biggest
army.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.420
But it is the most effective.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.400
Think about it… we are talking about a country
with less than 9 million inhabitants.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.570
Nonetheless, they have won wars against countries
10 times bigger.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:24.070
For example, during the 6 days war, Israel
confronted a coalition that included EGYPT,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.070
SYRIA and JORDAN.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:32.640
All of these countries put together summed
up to more than 130 million people.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.550
And they sent over 240,000 soldiers: twice
as much as the Israeli army did.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.470
In other words: no one would expect a victory
for Israel.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.530
But history was rather different.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:51.010
In just 6 days, the Israeli Defense Forces,
also known as IDF, wiped out their enemies.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.890
And yes, I know what you are gonna say now.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.970
The Israelis have the best technology and
weaponry, right?

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.590
Well… that is true now but it wasn’t back
then.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:03.089
For instance, in 1973, during the YOM KIPPUR
war, Israel’s weapons were as modern as

00:01:03.089 --> 00:01:06.940
those of their main rival, SYRIA.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:12.950
In fact, the IDF had some combat jets manufactured
in the 50s, the famous A4 Skyhawk.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:16.729
However, the Syrians had state of the art
anti-aircraft missiles, the S 200.

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:19.540
They were given to the Syrians by the Soviets
just 5 years before.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.820
And who won that war?

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:21.820
Exactly!

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:22.820
Israel!

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.899
OK, OK… now I can hear you saying…

00:01:23.899 --> 00:01:26.270
‘oh, come on Simon, but Israel has the support
of America!!!

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:29.280
That’s a really big help!!!’

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.420
And…

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:34.340
yes, in this point you are right.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:37.140
Israel is the country that receives the most
help from Uncle Sam.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:42.420
BUT… do you know of any other country who
buys the best weaponry from America?

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.420
Saudi Arabia!

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:47.119
The Saudies have an army as big and modern
as the Israelian one.

00:01:47.119 --> 00:01:50.229
But if you’ve been subscribed to VisualPolitik
for a long time, you already know the big

00:01:50.229 --> 00:01:54.560
failure of the Saudi army when they had to
fight guerrilla warriors, namely, those HOUTHIE

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.170
rebels from Yemen.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:02:00.350
In other words, neither the technology, nor
the American support are enough to explain

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:06.140
why the Israeli army is such a fearful one.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.899
So today the question is…

00:02:07.899 --> 00:02:10.340
Why is the Israeli army so powerful?

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.290
What are the key elements explaining such
a military success?

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:21.750
Today we are going to tell you the 5 key facts
that explain this.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.240
FAST DECISION MAKING

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.910
Every army is based on hierarchy and authority,
right?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.940
Well… some of them are more flexible than
others.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:34.280
In this other video, we explained you how
the Saudi army has a bigger sense of hierarchy

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:37.990
and the officials don’t have much power
to make their own decisions.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:41.580
The same goes with other arab countries like
SYRIA or EGYPT.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.090
So, here is an example.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:45.340
Imagine a Syrian unit defending a position.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.080
Let’s say their headquarters have been destroyed
before the soldiers in the front line are

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.440
aware of it.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:55.040
If they have to follow the normal procedure,
they will have to wait until someone gives

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.040
them an order.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.160
During this time, they don’t know if they
should retreat, strike back or coordinate

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.760
with other military units.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.490
And now you might wonder Why are the arab
armies so centralized?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.930
Don’t forget that most of those countries
are dictatorships or absolute monarchies.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:14.610
If you are a tyrant, you want your army to
be under your control, to micromanage every

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:19.260
Little decision in order to prevent a coup
d’etat.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.900
The Israeli army is way different from this.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.170
Let’s get back to the previous example.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:28.450
In this case, the Israeli commander on the
front line wouldn’t need to wait for orders.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.480
He has a degree of decision making power.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.450
So he can react immediately and seize the
time and the opportunities.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.690
In fact, this is pretty normal in all Western
armies.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.510
The big planning is centralized but the execution
is decentralized.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:46.550
This way, the organization is more flexible
and can react more quickly.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:52.600
But, unlike the Western countries, Israel
has something unique in their culture.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:58.400
We are talking about a pretty unknown fact
about this country but, yet, a very important

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.400
one.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:03.870
Israel is the least hierarchical country on
the planet, and you can feel this in every

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:04.870
aspect.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:09.200
Inside of an Israeli company, it’s pretty
normal for an average worker to have a discussion

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.290
with his boss.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:14.440
Debates are a common thing and there is a
pretty small sense of authority.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:22.570
Actually, in the 70s, a Dutch antropologist
named GEERT HOFSTEDE studied the power relationships

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.950
in different countries.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:28.810
Over the course of 6 years, he surveyed IBM
workers in different offices around the globe.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:32.080
This is how the ‘POWER DISTANCE INDEX’
was born.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:36.960
And among all those countries, Israel has
the lowest power distance, while the arab

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.879
countries like EGYPT or SAUDI ARABIA rank
among the highest.

00:04:40.879 --> 00:04:47.849
In other words, Israeli citizens are educated
in flexibility more than any other nation.

00:04:47.849 --> 00:04:48.849
INTERNAL COHESION

00:04:48.849 --> 00:04:53.259
In Israel, military service is mandatory for
every citizen, regardless of their social

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.740
condition or their gender.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:59.259
Both men and women, rich and poor start from
the bottom.

00:04:59.259 --> 00:05:05.979
Well… in fact, this is not exactly true.

00:05:05.979 --> 00:05:09.720
The ultra orthodox jews don’t need to do
this military service and the Palestinian

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.500
population are discriminated against.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:16.340
But the rest of Israel’s citizens must serve
in the military, and fall into a meritocratic

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:17.340
scheme.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:21.400
This means, everyone must follow the same
rules in order to be promoted.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.319
And this is not as common as you might think.

00:05:24.319 --> 00:05:28.410
For instance, during World War II, the aristocrats
who joined the British Army started with higher

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:33.740
positions than the peasants and the Working
class.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:40.800
And, of course, such elitism tends to destroy
an army’s morale and make it harder for

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:41.800
it to function.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.800
And the same happens in today’s arab armies.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:53.900
For example, the Saudi army consists of both
civil servants and members of the Royal family.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.770
And hierarchy matters a lot.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.129
The son of a Saudi prince will never be a
soldier.

00:05:58.129 --> 00:06:01.670
And, as you can imagine, this classist structure
has negative consequences.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:07.960
Consequences that have a lot to do with the
same key fact.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:08.960
COMBAT MORALE

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:14.110
In the year 1973, Israel fought the Egyptian
and the Syrian army at the same time.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:19.229
As we said at the beginning, back then, Israel
was not the technological powerhouse it is

00:06:19.229 --> 00:06:20.229
today.

00:06:20.229 --> 00:06:23.330
Syrians had those S 200s we mentioned before.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:28.340
And during the first days, those anti-aircraft
missiles destroyed a lot of Israeli combat

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.350
jets.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:32.550
Israel had to retreat.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:35.259
Nonetheless, Uncle Sam was here to help.

00:06:35.259 --> 00:06:39.150
The White House sent a Package of weapons
so they could neutralize the S 200s and the

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.150
radars.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:46.189
Things like FLARES that could confuse the
smart missiles that were guided by temperature.

00:06:46.189 --> 00:06:51.009
This way, the Israelis struck back and, in
little time, they finished the Syrian defenses.

00:06:51.009 --> 00:06:52.620
And… guess what happened next!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:07:02.490
Well, a lot of those arab soldiers, scared
of being wiped out from the air, they defected.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:06.330
If you look at the picture on the screen,
you will see 7 Syrian tanks.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.479
They are not moving but none of them is destroyed.

00:07:09.479 --> 00:07:11.610
What does this mean?

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:17.249
Well, it means the soldiers that were inside
of those tanks decided to run away.

00:07:17.249 --> 00:07:20.469
Defection is common when morale is low.

00:07:20.469 --> 00:07:23.979
And this is a common problem for arab armies.

00:07:23.979 --> 00:07:28.319
20 Syrian troops defect to southern Turkish
province of Hatay

00:07:28.319 --> 00:07:33.389
Think about it… if you are an Israeli soldier,
or an American one, you know you must be loyal

00:07:33.389 --> 00:07:34.589
to your country.

00:07:34.589 --> 00:07:42.289
But Arab soldiers have too many ethnic, national
and religious identities.

00:07:42.289 --> 00:07:46.340
Imagine you are a Syrian soldier and, at the
same time, you are a KURD, or you belong to

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.830
the muslim brotherhood.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.050
Both groups are chased by the Syrian government.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.659
So who are you loyal too?

00:07:51.659 --> 00:07:54.979
Of course, the army pays your bills but…
when your life is at risk and everything is

00:07:54.979 --> 00:07:55.979
lost…

00:07:55.979 --> 00:07:57.560
What is more important?

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.990
Your salary or your life?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:02.740
On other words…

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:06.810
no matter your wealth and your technology,
if your soldiers are not strongly motivated,

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:07.810
you have already lost.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:12.139
And the Israelis know this better than anyone…

00:08:12.139 --> 00:08:15.970
You will learn it now too…

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:16.999
HUMAN CAPITAL

00:08:16.999 --> 00:08:19.779
All tanks place their engines on the backside.

00:08:19.779 --> 00:08:20.889
Why?

00:08:20.889 --> 00:08:25.369
Because usually, the rockets hit on the frontside
and you want your tank to keep working even

00:08:25.369 --> 00:08:26.590
after being hit.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:31.680
This is why all the models, from the German
LEOPARDS to the Russian T 90s keep their engines

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.710
on the backside.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:37.169
Nonetheless, the Israeli army doesn’t value
the vehicle as much as their soldiers.

00:08:37.169 --> 00:08:42.039
This is why, the Israeli MERKAVA is the only
one of its kind that has the engines on the

00:08:42.039 --> 00:08:46.079
frontside.

00:08:46.079 --> 00:08:49.110
This way, a rocket on the frontside will destroy
the tank.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.940
Putting aside the ethics, Israel has a really
small population.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.839
That means that they can’t allow themselves
to lose too many soldiers.

00:08:55.839 --> 00:09:00.630
This is why they receive much more intense
training, with real bullets and better equipment.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:05.270
Don’t forget this is the country where KRAV
MAGA, one of the most advanced martial arts,

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.270
was born.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:11.110
You can see this human capital doctrine reflected
in their intelligence service, the MOSSAD.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:17.190
It is considered one of the best in the entire
world.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.970
And if one day you happen to travel to Israel,
you should know that they will take your phone

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:24.920
number and other data because they know information
is power.

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:28.680
But, OK, OK, I know what you want to hear
now.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:35.320
You came to this video because you wanted
to hear about state of the art weaponry, right?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:41.509
Well… here you have it!

00:09:41.509 --> 00:09:42.839
MADE IN ISRAEL

00:09:42.839 --> 00:09:46.170
During the 80s, the Israeli Government wanted
a secret weapon.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:49.600
A weapon no one had ever heard of until recently.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:55.820
So they met a local manufacturer, a company
called RAFAEL, to design a very special vehicle,

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.430
the so called PEREH.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:05.139
This is a vehicle that looks like a tank but,
in fact, is a tank hunter weapon with a big

00:10:05.139 --> 00:10:06.139
rocket launcher.

00:10:06.139 --> 00:10:07.940
If you know about weapons, you know there
is a big difference.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:11.319
Tanks have a reach of between 2 and 4 kilometers.

00:10:11.319 --> 00:10:14.640
PEREH rockets can reach a distance of 30 kilometers.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.160
So imagine the situation.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.750
The enemies would take satellite pictures
to see the Israeli weaponry.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.910
And they would see a lot of normal tanks.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.709
Based on this, they would plan their strategy.

00:10:23.709 --> 00:10:25.389
But then, surprise!

00:10:25.389 --> 00:10:31.670
Those tanks are not tanks but, in fact, something
with a much bigger reach.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:39.050
For decades, this PEREH was one of the most
mysterious weapons of the Israeli army.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:42.339
And their main strength was that no one knew
anything about them!

00:10:42.339 --> 00:10:46.680
So now the question is home come Israel makes
its own secret weapons and other countries

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.680
don’t?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:51.500
The answer is that in Israel there are lots
of rocket science companies that make a world

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.759
class defense industry.

00:10:52.759 --> 00:10:56.390
Do you remember this video where I told you
about the Israeli startups?

00:10:56.390 --> 00:11:01.170
In the 80s, the Israeli government created
a special program, the so called YOZMA.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:06.320
This program consisted of 10 hedge funds with
both, private and government money.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.199
Those funds helped to create lots of tech
companies.

00:11:09.199 --> 00:11:12.790
And do you know what was the favourite industry
for those brand new startups?

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:13.790
Of course!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:14.790
The military industry!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.670
At the end of the day, the army was a rich
and reliable client.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.670
All of a sudden, dozens of weapon manufacturers
were born.

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:25.699
Companies that created customized products
that met the exact needs the Israeli army

00:11:25.699 --> 00:11:28.199
had at any given moment.

00:11:28.199 --> 00:11:34.889
From the IRON DOME defense system to the MERKAVA
tanks or the PEREH we mentioned before.

00:11:34.889 --> 00:11:35.889
Nonetheless…

00:11:35.889 --> 00:11:37.209
What happened in the other countries?

00:11:37.209 --> 00:11:39.110
What happened in Saudi Arabia?

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:43.279
As you know, the Saudi economy has a problem:
it relies heavily on the oil industry.

00:11:43.279 --> 00:11:47.380
Of course, thanks to the dinosaur juice, the
saudies have become rich and they can pay

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:55.940
for the 3rd biggest army in the World, only
surpassed by China and America.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.790
But expensive is not a synonym for good.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:03.070
The Saudi army buys their tanks from the USA,
and those are customized for the needs of

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.370
the American army.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:08.079
Besides, that makes it harder to have a secret
weapon because everyone knows what you bought

00:12:08.079 --> 00:12:09.620
on the international market.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.459
And yes, I know what you are thinking.

00:12:13.459 --> 00:12:17.570
On this video, it seems we are talking marvels
about the Israelis, right?

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:21.160
Make no mistake, the Israeli army has its
weak points.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:24.570
In fact, there is an organization that could
make their life harder.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:31.030
But we will talk about it in another video.

